        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Jerusalem dang khou kalvari ching khou,",
            "Kanloumeipu thingru khou jaithao pui bam;",
            "Khou 4@& buamang thanmei rui duang gutro.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Hou khang ninge kanloumei puta,",
            "Kaphai kaban kanak khou jam 4@& rui,",
            "Nkhuaimei ajang khou rui khanglou the.",
            "",
            "2. Judah daimei nun le amuh nun 4@& rui,",
            "Sinnui lana jao bam Zion pilung khou;",
            "Siangding thing rukhou 4@& hianbin lou the.",
            "",
            "3. Guanga jaolo! kanloumeipu njangmei,",
            "Rianra rianriu khanga Zion pilung khou;",
            "Simei rui gumliamma kajao sithe.",
            "",
            "4. Tingkau Guang Nah theinung thanmeinun chunsi,",
            "Kaniu Guang theimeita jao ngam mei makge;",
            "Poubaumei thei puinung kandih jing e."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
